@RCYD857/dsh-pdf-patched README · 857-dsh-pdf-patched：> PDF parsing toolkit for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) — three agent-facing tools (`pdf_info` / `pdf_extract_text` / `pdf_render_page`) with hybrid engines, including system-font rendering for PDFs with non-embedded CJK fonts (e.g. EasyEDA / JLC EDA schematic exports).

[English](README.md) | [中文](README.zh.md)

**Tags:** `dsh-plugin` · `pdf` · `pdfjs` · `canvas` · `schematic` · `tools`

@RCYD857/dsh-pdf-patched README · Why a custom renderer?：Text extraction uses the same auto-selection: embedded fonts → pdfjs
text layer; non-embedded fonts → the built-in decoder (which correctly
recovers CJK text pdfjs loses).
